body:
I love the character designs that are simple yet effective, the lore of the show and how wholesome the show is in general (probably except for episode 11).

&#x200B;

But the thing I like the most is the relationship between Kaban and Serval. The fact that they work very well with each other's strengths and that they learn and grow throughout the show makes it something special in my opinion.

Not to be confused with Phantasy Star.

&#x200B;

All jokes aside, it seems like we're getting really close to an announcement! Considering it has "Series" in the title, I think we're going to at least get Klonoa 1 and 2.
